  "controlsRationale": "Release-driven arrows move selection/ships/shot target through the left pad with repeatReleaseKeys. Enter places then confirms each of eight ships, accepts player handoff, and fires. R rotates and E finds the next free tile for an already placed ship. ESC resets to the menu, whose Down/Down/Enter exits. External panel supports full local two-player play on one device. Pointer off intentionally uses the complete authored keyboard path; original optional mouse driver never completes packet byte1, so mouse control is not claimed.",
